caramos-app-center (0.2.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Remove apps from the app picker: an installed app's card has a Remove
    button. It asks first, removes the app for every user (documents and
    other files stay) and shows the progress like an installation. Apps that
    come with CaramOS (Firefox) have none.

