caramos-app-center (0.1.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * CaramOS 1.0.21 ships no Zalo: the recommended set now preselects Zalo
    (the build with voice and video calls) and the chat section no longer
    says a light Zalo is installed.
  * The Zalo recipe writes its menu launcher with the App Center's Zalo icon
    and removes Zalo entirely on remove, since there is no light build to
    go back to.

